Summer after or during junior year?

00:48:24.840 --> 00:48:26.350
I did summer after sophomore
and summer after junior.

00:48:26.350 --> 00:48:29.380
Okay, so in that realm.

00:48:29.380 --> 00:48:30.740
So we were having this conversation.

