00:49:59.360 --> 00:50:02.120
hey you can take this
thing you're interested in

00:50:02.120 --> 00:50:03.820
and turn it into the rest of your life.

00:50:03.820 --> 00:50:06.730
Like you were having those
basketball conversations

00:50:06.730 --> 00:50:09.010
with your dad you know right?

00:50:09.010 --> 00:50:11.420
So for me, and that's
just not really the way

00:50:11.420 --> 00:50:13.035
that I think.

00:50:13.035 --> 00:50:16.706
But I had this deeply
rooted feeling of like,

00:50:16.706 --> 00:50:21.706
I mean, maybe it's even
attachment to our friendship.

00:50:23.180 --> 00:50:24.725
You know so it's like,

00:50:24.725 --> 00:50:27.250
I'm sure it wasn't my
idea to go to summer camp

00:50:27.250 --> 00:50:29.620
